# Filled questionnaires (generate_questionnaire.py render) -- a rendered
# file in this directory carries a real business answer once an expert
# fills it in, however it ends up named (renamed, exported to .docx,
# nested under --out-dir). Ignore the whole directory, not a filename
# glob -- a glob only catches files that keep the exact prefix+extension
# the generator itself writes, and a filled/renamed artifact routinely
# won't.
# questionnaire_routing.json stays tracked -- it's an input, not output.
questionnaires/

# Local publishing checklist, not part of the tutorial.
PUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md
